{"data":{"id":1400563508,"totalResults":49,"items":[{"quote":"Challenging, frustrating, invigorating, and oh-so fulfilling, Silksong is simply a masterpiece in almost every way.","score":100,"url":"https://gamingbolt.com/hollow-knight-silksong-review-i-venture-forth-to-hunt","date":"2025-09-08","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"GamingBolt","publicationSlug":"gamingbolt","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400563508,"type":"games","title":"Hollow Knight: Silksong","url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":90},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400563508,"name":"Hollow Knight: Silksong"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"In my nearly ten years here at Gamereactor, I have so far managed to award three perfect scores, and now it's time again. Hollow Knight: Silksong is a masterpiece, simply put. No question about it. Expectations were sky-high in advance, but with a lot of patience and even more skill, Team Cherry has managed to rise above the competition and cement its place in the starry sky as one of the brightest shining celestial bodies. If you like challenging video games in general and well-made Metroidvania titles in particular, I cannot recommend Hollow Knight: Silksong enough, because it's a game that enchants and challenges, dazzles and delights. And finally, for those of you who are wondering: Yes, it was definitely worth the wait.","score":100,"url":"https://www.gamereactor.eu/hollow-knight-silksong-1597823/","date":"2025-09-08","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Gamereactor UK","publicationSlug":"gamereactor-uk","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400563508,"type":"games","title":"Hollow Knight: Silksong","url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":90},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400563508,"name":"Hollow Knight: Silksong"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Silksong is the purest form of a Metroidvania I've played in years.","score":100,"url":"https://screenrant.com/review-hollow-knight-silksong/","date":"2025-09-08","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Screen Rant","publicationSlug":"screen-rant","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400563508,"type":"games","title":"Hollow Knight: Silksong","url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":90},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400563508,"name":"Hollow Knight: Silksong"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Hollow Knight: Silksong is, quite simply, a video game that shouldn’t exist. No publisher on Earth would ever fund the production of a colossal two-dimensional Metroidvania over the span of seven years, and no independent developer could realistically afford to turn such an immense ambition into reality. And yet, Hollow Knight: Silksong does exist, and it exists solely because a group of creators - deeply in love with their own work but above all blessed with extraordinary talent and the resources to make it shine - chose to invest seven years of their lives in the project. There has never been a Metroidvania so vast in content and so profound in its systems, nor one that marries such sheer scale with such painstaking artistry. On one hand, it is an experience of staggering proportions; on the other, it is enriched with the kind of craft and care one usually finds only in artisanal workshops. In the industry, it’s often said that this genre carries a fragment of the medium’s very soul. Playing through Hornet’s adventure is a reminder, plain and simple, of how beautiful it is to experience a video game made with love.","score":100,"url":"https://multiplayer.it/recensioni/hollow-knight-silksong-recensione.html","date":"2025-09-09","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Multiplayer.it","publicationSlug":"multiplayerit","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400563508,"type":"games","title":"Hollow Knight: Silksong","url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":90},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400563508,"name":"Hollow Knight: Silksong"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"For many years, Hollow Knight held the crown of the indie scene, but its successor has arrived to improve on what was already unbeatable. Hollow Knight: Silksong stands as one of the most refined, creative, profound, and elevated works in the history of video games, presenting itself as a leading candidate for Best Game of the Year and clinging to its predecessor's scepter to establish itself as, if we can still define it that way, the best indie game in history. Team Cherry has created an adventure for posterity that excels in everything and languishes in nothing, ultimately making a statement in an industry whose blockbusters could only dream of achieving such a level of divinity.","score":100,"url":"https://areajugones.sport.es/videojuegos/analisis-de-hollow-knight-silksong-tenemos-nuevo-mejor-indie-de-la-historia/","date":"2025-09-10","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Areajugones","publicationSlug":"areajugones","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400563508,"type":"games","title":"Hollow Knight: Silksong","url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":90},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400563508,"name":"Hollow Knight: Silksong"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Pretty and charmingly mean-spirited, this is a game filled with revelations and genuine personality.","score":100,"url":"https://www.eurogamer.net/hollow-knight-silksong-review","date":"2025-09-11","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Eurogamer","publicationSlug":"eurogamer","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400563508,"type":"games","title":"Hollow Knight: Silksong","url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":90},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400563508,"name":"Hollow Knight: Silksong"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Hollow Knight: Silksong won’t convert the non-believers but it’s a brilliant all-time entry in the Metroidvania genre. Some slight hiccups around grinding and platform jumping aside, it’s a thrilling diversion and, just about, worth the wait.","score":100,"url":"https://www.nme.com/reviews/game-reviews/hollow-knight-silksong-review-team-cherry-3892018","date":"2025-09-12","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"NME","publicationSlug":"nme","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400563508,"type":"games","title":"Hollow Knight: Silksong","url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":90},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400563508,"name":"Hollow Knight: Silksong"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Hollow Knight: Silksong manages to be a surprisingly great sequel to a title that was all-too difficult to follow up. If you're a fan of the series, you'll find no better way to feel back home than in this sequel, but newcomers should still stick to exploring Hallownest for their first venture.","score":100,"url":"https://www.gamegrin.com/reviews/hollow-knight-silksong-review/","date":"2025-09-14","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"GameGrin","publicationSlug":"gamegrin","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400563508,"type":"games","title":"Hollow Knight: Silksong","url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":90},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400563508,"name":"Hollow Knight: Silksong"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"“Silksong” is like a book written in the language of ancient gamers, and I am one of them.","score":100,"url":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/entertainment/video-games/2025/09/18/hollow-knight-silksong-review-difficulty/","date":"2025-09-18","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Washington Post","publicationSlug":"washington-post","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400563508,"type":"games","title":"Hollow Knight: Silksong","url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":90},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400563508,"name":"Hollow Knight: Silksong"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Silksong spins yarns of pain and freedom into a breathtaking Metroidvania fill of surprise and secrets.","score":100,"url":"https://www.eurogamer.de/hollow-knight-silksong-test-das-letzte-review-das-ihr-zu-silksong-lesen-musst","date":"2025-09-20","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Eurogamer Germany","publicationSlug":"eurogamer-germany","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400563508,"type":"games","title":"Hollow Knight: Silksong","url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/hollow-knight-silksong/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":90},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400563508,"name":"Hollow Knight: Silksong"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"}]},"links":{"self":{